      "extract": "We quantize the Einstein gravity in the formalism of weak gravitational ﬁelds by using the constrained Hamiltonian method. Special emphasis is given to the 2+1 spacetime dimensional case where a (topological) Chern-Simons term is added to the Lagrangian. PACS: 03.70.+k; 04.20.Fy; 11.30.-j (∗) Electronic mails: ift03001 @ ufrj and barcelos @ vms1.nce.ufrj.br 1",
