        }
      ],
      "extract": "We have studied the quantization of the Einstein gravitational theory in the formalism of weak gravitational ﬁelds. This is a high constrained system and we have used the Hamiltonian Dirac method to quantize it. We have given a particular emphasis to the case of the spacetime dimension D=2+1 where a CS term can be added. The ﬁnal propagators in this case exhibit a massive (topological) pole. This result is in",
